    "reading": "The chain's own segment trace shows loss 4.94 at segment step 30 rising to 35.22 by step 220, a divergence within ~200 steps of resuming. The replayed plain arm from the 1,000-step checkpoint keeps loss bounded (max 8.81) yet still loses gate accuracy: development F1 at logit 0.0 falls 0.7362 -> 0.5636 across steps 1,000 -> 1,300 while the best swept threshold jumps 2.85 -> -0.15 -> 1.05 -> 4.35."
